    <string name="location_dialog_title">Location Sharing</string>
    <string name="location_dialog_message">Relatives collects your location to show your position and available history to members of your family group, even when the app is closed or not in use. While sharing is active, your family can request a fresh position. Relatives uses a visible notification so you can stop sharing at any time.</string>
